{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18301340","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18301340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1830134001:1":{"text":"말도 마. 여긴 맛있는 게 아예 없어. 기껏해야 레오프론 요리를 먹을 수 있는 곳이 있는데, 맛도 그냥 그래.","source_cn":"别提了，这里根本没有美食。顶多能吃到一些从耀光传过来的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50D4103E29EDF675","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1830134002:0":{"text":"말도 마. 여긴 맛있는 게 아예 없어. 기껏해야 레오프론 요리를 먹을 수 있는 곳이 있는데, 맛도 그냥 그래.","source_cn":"昨天吃了一道据说传自耀光的红酒炖牛肉，吃起来全是防腐香...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF5C4520E6699268","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1830134003:1":{"text":"됐어. 여기 요리사들은 전부 그레이브본이잖아. 죽은 지 워낙 오래돼서 조리법도 진작 바뀌었을 걸.","source_cn":"算了吧，这里的厨子都是亡灵。死了那么久了，做法早就走样了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8479212B2369685C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1830134004:1":{"text":"레오프론으로 돌아가고 싶어. 길거리에서 파는 고기 파이가 훨씬 낫겠네.","source_cn":"我想回耀光了。哪怕街边一块热乎的肉馅饼，也比这里强。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31160CFB03E2B17C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1830134005:1":{"text":"하아, 여기서 오래 지내다 보니 갓 구운 빵이 어떤 맛이었는지도 잊어버렸어...","source_cn":"唉，在这里待久了，我都快忘了刚出炉的面包是什么味道了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BE5A42B9E007A0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:斯丹利":{"text":"스탄리","source":"斯丹利","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:弗农":{"text":"버논","source":"弗农","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}}